2. Sources
----------

Story data (Bobiverse Wiki)
    Book, chapter, character and timeline details were researched from the
    Bobiverse Wiki (https://bobiverse.fandom.com) by its contributors and from
    fan timelines. Wiki text is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Descriptions in this
    data file were written for it or adapted (summarised, reworded and
    arranged by chapter) from those sources. Adapted material is shared under
    CC BY-SA 4.0, as CC BY-SA 3.0 section 4(b) allows. Sources for each Bob are
    listed in his record. The credited sources do not endorse this project.

Star positions (HYG Database)
    HYG Database v4.1 by astronexus (David Nash),
    https://codeberg.org/astronexus/hyg, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Converted to the map's
    coordinates and filtered to the stars shown. The derived star data is
    shared under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Other astronomy sources
    Some distant positions: this project has made use of the SIMBAD database,
    operated at CDS, Strasbourg, France, and of Wikipedia.

Lineage cross-check
    Some lineage details were cross-checked against bobiverse-map by
    thunfischtoast (https://github.com/thunfischtoast/bobiverse-map),
    CC BY-SA 4.0.


